        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "scene": "s2",
      "segment_index": 1,
      "sentences": [
        {
          "index": 0,
          "text": "今天GitHub榜首，一天掌了一千四百多星。",
          "start": 0.1,
          "end": 3.18
        },
        {
          "index": 1,
          "text": "叫book-to-skill，把技术书的PDF，变成AI编程助手能调用的技能。",
          "start": 3.13,
          "end": 7.98
        },
        {
          "index": 2,
          "text": "几百页厚书不用啃，知识从读变成用。",
          "start": 7.98,
          "end": 11.19
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "scene": "s3",
      "segment_index": 2,
      "sentences": [
        {
          "index": 0,
          "text": "还有两个上榜的。",
          "start": 0.1,
          "end": 1.68
        },
        {
          "index": 1,
          "text": "superpowers二十六万星，把开发经验固化成能复用的技能。",
          "start": 1.63,
          "end": 5.79
        },
        {
          "index": 2,
          "text": "jcode同样跑AI编程，内存只占同类零头，Rust写的，老电脑也带得动。",
          "start": 5.79,
          "end": 11.5
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "scene": "s4",
      "segment_index": 3,
      "sentences": [
